es `get()` and its eagerly initialized singleton.\n- Clarifies command-attribute behavior and tests explicit opt-out.\n- Documents the API migration.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| instrumentation/\u200bresources/\u200blibrary/\u200bsrc/\u200btest/\u200bjava/\u200bio/\u200bopentelemetry/\u200binstrumentation/\u200bresources/\u200bProcessResourceTest.java | Tests `create(false)` privacy behavior. |\r\n| instrumentation/\u200bresources/\u200blibrary/\u200bsrc/\u200bmain/\u200bjava/\u200bio/\u200bopentelemetry/\u200binstrumentation/\u200bresources/\u200bProcessResource.java | Removes deprecated accessor and clarifies factory documentation. |\r\n| CHANGELOG.md | Records removal and replacement factories. |\n</details>\n\n<sub>Review effort: Balanced</sub>","comment_id":null,"key":"review:5590053812","kind":"body","line":null,"path":null,"review_id":5590053812},{"body":"[General] Move this entry to `\u26a0\ufe0f Breaking changes to non-stable APIs` at CHANGELOG.md:294. `ProcessResource` belongs to the alpha resources library, so placing its removal under general breaking changes obscures the stable/non-stable API distinction required by `.github/copilot-instructions.md:35\u201336`. Keep the migration guidance when moving it.","comment_commit_id":"213df16f7c880e35bde8817f460cf58d2a46b7c3","comment_id":4328976440,"key":"inline:4328976440","kind":"inline","line":18,"original_commit_id":"213df16f7c880e35bde8817f460cf58d2a46b7c3","original_line":18,"path":"CHANGELOG.md","review_commit_id":"213df16f7c880e35bde8817f460cf58d2a46b7c3","review_id":5590053812,"review_submitted_at":"2026-10-20T18:55:40Z","root_author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"thread_context":[{"author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"body_hash":"b31b621196ae35bae0a54c1cded625577c9a27e1bdc2076d03550704bc10bb34","id":4328976440,"parent":null,"updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:55:40Z"}],"thread_id":"PRRT_kwDODJKVX86ueeEE"}],"frozen_at":1792525099,"frozen_at_iso":"2026-10-20T19:38:19Z","frozen_sha":"213df16f7c880e35bde8817f460cf58d2a46b7c3","head_ref":"copilot/update-supported-api-config","head_repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","head_repo_id":210933087,"input_mode":"direct","launch_run":{"actor_id":218610,"attempt":1,"id":39485130640},"loop_kind":"copilot_review","metadata":{"body":"<!--\nCHANGELOG.md is generated from merged pull requests. Do not add an entry unless this PR introduces\na deprecation or breaking change.\n-->\n\nRemove `ProcessResource.get()` and its eagerly initialized singleton while preserving the supported factories and their privacy behavior.\n\n- **API:** Document that `create()` omits command-line attributes; `create(boolean)` includes them only when explicitly enabled. Add coverage for `create(false)` and record the breaking-change migration.\n- **Migration:**\n  ```java\n  // Before\n  Resource resource = ProcessResource.get();\n\n  // Privacy-safe default\n  Resource resource = ProcessResource.create();\n\n  // Only when command attributes are intended\n  Resource resource = ProcessResource.create(true);\n  ```","title":"Remove deprecated ProcessResource accessor"},"mode":"publish","pr":20770,"pr_author_id":198982749,"protocol":"git-candidate-v1","publication":{"auth_mode":"fine_grained_pat","authorized_actor_id":218610,"authorized_at":1792525100,"generation":1,"max_pipelines":5,"phase":"3e5551cb294845e7bbb177a20b21a5ca","profile":"git-candidate-v1","required_checks":[]},"repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","repo_id":210933087,"request_id":"7616fad893ac4e6b8c5c49e02bc12b36","schema":2,"source_private":false,"target_private":false,"workflow_ref":"review-loop-revisions/702f9d0316fccd229b4e90e9a01723d297e91b81","workflow_revision":"702f9d0316fccd229b4e90e9a01723d297e91b81"},"review_request":{"baseline_review_ids":[5590053812,5590868501],"baseline_run_ids":[39487361844,39487361850,39487361875,39487362554,39487362831],"claim":"b4fd4a5c674